step.7 = Rig, keyer and sound
step.7.text = Settings > Setup wizard sets up the rig (Options > Rig 1), the CW keyer (Options > CW keyer), sound for FT8, RTTY and voice (Options > Sound), a remote station, and a shared log. The toolbar icons at the top right show whether each device is connected.
